	quests: [
		{
			title: "Making It Your Home"
			x: -1.75d
			y: 0.5d
			shape: "octagon"
			description: [
				"&eOne nice thing about exploring and traveling, is you can find some real nice places to make a base. Or a new home! Or both, really. The world is your drawing board. My name is Designer Daisy. Or, well, Decorator Daisy fits as well. And Developer? Yes, many names, many titles, but nice to meet you again Bandit!"
				""
				"&eAin't no way to look it otherwise, you are probably gonna be  stuck in there for a while. Like last time, it isn't gonna be an easy, or quick, task of getting you out of there."
				""
				"&eSo we gotta look at all the options ya get in the FOP Game Server for building yourself a nice place, and also protecting it of course."
			]
			dependencies: ["1D0853ADC7295AEB"]
			id: "06FED1C3C1EA8361"
			tasks: [{
				id: "6B29E70AA25F63C2"
				type: "checkmark"
			}]
		}
		{
			title: "A Palette of Choices"
			x: 0.25d
			y: -3.0d
			shape: "square"
			subtitle: "MOD : Architecture's Palette"
			description: [
				"&eBuilding with classic materials is great, and what you can usually find around the most it feels like."
				""
				"&eBut there's a world of textures, and colors, and designs to take advantage of. Even in a game server!"
				""
				"&eNo, especially in the FOP Game Server! Not all the normal rules of physics apply to you! Floating rooftops, hundred block long vines!"
				""
				"&eTake this... I guess the FOP call it a 'brand', or a product line since they sell these outside the Game Server..."
				""
				"&eNo no, back on topic Daisy...The Architect's Palette is a series of blocks and designs that can make a build pop just right."
			]
			hide_dependency_lines: true
			dependencies: ["06FED1C3C1EA8361"]
