		}
		{
			title: "Storing Pretty"
			x: 1.25d
			y: -3.0d
			shape: "rsquare"
			description: [
				"&eThe blocks of metal you can make? Those can look really pretty I have to say. Or nice and rugged. They can fit into a lot of different build designs."
				""
				"&eNo different for certain other storage blocks! Even a block of Rotten Flesh has a certain look, perfect for horror attractions!"
			]
