		{
			title: "Broader Colors"
			x: 0.25d
			y: -1.5d
			shape: "square"
			subtitle: "MOD : Block Diversity"
			description: [
				"&eEver feel that the sixteen colors of the base FOP Game Server gives you just isn't enough? Sure there are items here and there outside those colors, but it never seems enough."
				""
				"&eThere's a 'brand' the FOP introduced recently (and suspiciously similar to an older brand  we were looking at....but I digress!). It's called Block Diversity."
				""
				"&eIt adds a variety of extra colors to the set, and some very lovely options for building with them!"
			]
			hide_dependency_lines: true
			dependencies: ["06FED1C3C1EA8361"]
