		}
		{
			title: "Special Shapes"
			x: 1.25d
			y: -1.5d
			shape: "rsquare"
			description: [
				"&eBlock Diversity also adds a lot of neat alternate block styles. This includes flat plates, which are like... octonal slabs? Octal slabs? No wait, whats a sixteenth of a block..."
				""
				"&eAnyways! It also adds some nice and fancy fences, quarter stairs, and more!"
			]
