		{
			title: "A Few Lines Difference"
			x: -3.5d
			y: -1.5d
			shape: "square"
			subtitle: "MOD : Chisel"
			description: [
				"&eIt's quite amazing the difference a few lines can make in a design. As simple as an extra line here, a removed line there, and it feels brand new."
				""
				"&eYou can take Chisel for example. Just some simple line changes and you have a good variety with a single block."
				""
				"&eJust make an Iron Chisel, and Right Click with it. You can then put in stone, wool, wood, etc and many of them will have Chiseled varieties of designs."
			]
			hide_dependency_lines: true
			dependencies: ["06FED1C3C1EA8361"]
			id: "749B56B34708C3D7"
			tasks: [{
				id: "76AB6EE95D39E420"
