		{
			title: "Dream Designs"
			x: 3.75d
			y: 1.25d
			shape: "square"
			subtitle: "MOD : Structurize"
			description: [
				"&eOne of the benefits of starting your own branch of The Ferret Business is you can have your colonists help build new buildings you design!"
				""
				"&eIf you haven't started your own branch yet...go check out the \"You and What Army\" research section!"
				""
				"&eAnyways, the brand is called Structurize. You can see it offers a HUGE variety of blocks for your building designs! But the big things are the three tools it provides."
				""
				"&eThe Scan Tool can be used to select an area. Left Click to select the first corner of a cube, and Right Click to select the opposite corner. Then Right Click the Scan tool in the air to see the selection area. You can then set a name for it, see what resources it takes to build, etc. Hitting the Checkmark saves the selection to a 'blueprint' in your system."
			]
			hide_dependency_lines: true
			dependencies: ["06FED1C3C1EA8361"]
			id: "5E13074E1C1E6445"
			tasks: [{
				id: "6FA92FD5028EBAC9"
				type: "item"
				item: "structurize:sceptersteel"
			}]
			rewards: [{
				id: "2AAB8455E9A444E9"
				type: "choice"
				table_id: 2640422954496342337L
			}]
		}
		{
			title: "Construction Crew"
			x: 4.75d
			y: 1.25d
			shape: "rsquare"
			description: [
				"&eNow that you have a saved design, you can go over to your Minecolony and Right Click the ground with the Build Tool. Here you can choose from a few premade designs, as well as any design you've saved with the Scan tool."
				""
				"&eSelect and position it, then when you confirm your Colonists will come over and build the structure (as long as you have the materials in storage!)."
				""
				"&eThe Shape Tool is another helpful tool Structurize provides. You need to select an area like the Scan tool, but when you Right Click it up in the air, you can choose what blocks and shape will be built there."
			]
			dependencies: ["5E13074E1C1E6445"]
			id: "6B119B205F3D03F3"
			tasks: [
				{
					id: "102DA67F9064588D"
